// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Daedalus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2292978780" "Daedalus"
// LocationString :
"P3689669095" "Cimerora Peninsula"
// ProfessionString :
"P2239241952" "Dedicated Defender of Cimerora"
// DescriptionString :
"P3155023023" "Daedalus is the finest crafter these ancient times have ever seen. His gift borders on Celestial, but is in fact simply his own genius at work."
// HelloString :
"P2906894113" "Ave, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1658622802" "Funny thing is, I'm an auto-issue contact, so you should probably never see this."
// FirstVisitString :
"P593501616" "Well met, stranger. I am Daedalus, a craftsman and defender of this land. Your arrival is well-timed, for I am in need of aid."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4133900688" "Your aid has been a tremendous boon to me, {HeroName}. I am proud to call you friend. I have no more tasks for which I need assistance."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P943044368" "Your heroic heart has caused you to accept much responsibility. I would not add to your burden at this time. Pray return later, when there is less weight on your shoulders."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3982619523" "I fear that my problems would be too heavy of a burden for you to bear at this point. Pray return when you are more seasoned and perhaps you can aid me then.<br><br><color orange>Come back when you are Security Level 40.</color>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P746672750" "I am proud to call you my friend, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3921555657" "Truly, the gods did smile on me when they caused our paths to cross, {HeroName}. You are a boon companion and a comfort to me."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2954372161" "I mistrust your motives, {HeroName}, and mistrust you. Leave me be."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4198709500" "I don't think it's possible for you to ever see this, unless we raise the level cap or something."
// IntroString :
"P1040925904" "You need to meet the Mission Giver."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2618060254" "Meet Mission Giver."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P854284900" "Now that you can met him, all is right with the world."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4020465395" "I really don't do introductions."
