// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Imperious 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Imperious 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1987342420" "Imperious"
// ProfessionString :
"P1329168825" "Deposed ruler of Cimerora"
// DescriptionString :
"P870365554" "Imperious was once the ruler of the seaside kingdom of Cimerora, until he was ousted by a splinter group of his own men. The traitors allied with an unknown force who granted them power beyond their imagination. Now, Imperious has taken over a small area of his once proud land and attempts to thwart this unknown force and return the kingdom to its rightful owner... himself."
// LocationString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1434915206" "Well met.<br><br>I am Imperious, deposed ruler of Cimerora. My men and I have fallen back to this outpost as we plan our attack to retake our lands. But much work has to be done before that can happen. Montague Castanella told me that he would send people to aid me from his land. I welcome the help."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P3779072377" "You are a brave warrior, but you are not yet ready for this battle, I fear."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P482614238" "Your strength and courage is truly something to behold.  The problems of an old deposed ruler and his small kingdom must be meaningless to one such as you.  Perhaps there are other events for one as powerful as you to deal with."
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3235592949" "The quest that I have for you requires a much larger party than you currently have.<br><br><color orange>Come back to me when you have a total of six heroes or villains in your group.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2729696191" "Send the commander of your group to come speak with me."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3491678930" "I would like to speak to the commander of your group.  If you would be so kind as to arrange it, I would be grateful."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2622220848" "This task is an important one and I do not have the strength or patience to repeat it.  Please ensure that all of the warriors in your group are present before you seek the details."
// TaskForceName :
"P628689500" "Bucina"
// TaskForceName :
"P1404513791" "Cornu"
// TaskForceName :
"P1582480102" "Hydraulis"
// TaskForceName :
"P120834753" "Tibiae"
// HelloString :
"P856719880" "Greetings."
// HelloString :
"P2204599434" "Welcome"
// HelloString :
"P3940992001" "My I assist you?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1949490552" "I am unfamiliar with you, stranger. Are you here to aid me or are you here to aid my enemies? Either way, be quick about it. I have much work to be done."
// FirstVisitString :
"P856364347" ""
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3562440100" "You have done all you can for me and my people. For that, I thank you.<br><br>Please feel free to linger here as long as you like. If events change and I need assistance, yours will be the first I seek."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4222690694" "I do not know of what you speak, stranger."
// IntroString :
"P1188725747" "There is a man I want you to meet. He is not from this time or place, but from an ancient land called Cimerora. He is...or at least was, the ruler of those people. However, that is no longer the case.<br><br>He does not comprehend the role that he and his people play to the future of heroes and villains everywhere.  Make no mistake:  it is a crucial one.  Please seek him out and give him aid."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4208725653" "Agree to meet Imperious"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1451471540" "Imperious is not a man to ask for help, but he, above all others, needs just that. You will have to travel back through my own Aspect of the Pillar to get to him. You will find it located inside the Midnighter Club."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4117837257" "It is time that I revealed to you the truth of your introduction to the Midnight Squad."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


