// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Marcus_Valerius 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Marcus Valerius 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3899846390" "Marcus Valerius"
// ProfessionString :
"P2858265429" "Former Captain of the Guard"
// DescriptionString :
"P2705344212" "Marcus Habitus Valerius is the former Captain of the Guard under the rule of Imperious within the kingdom of Cimerora.  When Imperious was traitorously ousted by a splinter group of his own men, Marcus Valerius fought alongside him.  He continues to work for the deposed ruler in a small fortress just outside the walls of his old kingdom."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
// HelloString :
"P1536418610" "Hail."
// HelloString :
"P1362776189" "Good day."
// HelloString :
"P2957948004" "I am at your service."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P968498942" "We have not yet been properly introduced.  Do not darken my presence unless you have specific business with me."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2937716189" "I am Marcus Valerius, former Captain of the Guard to Imperious.  Imperious has been betrayed by some of his own followers and ousted as the ruler of Cimerora.  I stand alongside him because I know that he is a great and noble ruler.  He will one day regain his authority over his kingdom and I will help him crush those who seek to keep him from his rule."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3152335677" "You are a loyal soldier and your work has been most helpful to Imperious and myself.  I have nothing left for you at this time, however if ever that changes, rest assured that you will be the first soldier that I seek.  I am in your debt."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P861878451" "You insult me.  I cannot use you if others have claimed your time before me.  Go then.  Complete your tasks and return to me when you may properly dedicate your time to our cause."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2765121627" "You speak in riddles, stranger.  Riddles that I do not understand."
// IntroString :
"P3980846866" "I want you to meet the former Captain of the Guard, <color orange>Marcus Valerius</color>.  He is Imperious' most trusted soldier and stood by him when his kingdom fell to the traitors.  Marcus tirelessly dedicates his life to restoring Imperious' kingdom and is always in need of men and women to aid him in this ceaseless task.  If you are willing, I will send an official introduction on your behalf."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P162317203" "Agree to be introduced to Marcus Valerius"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2658341592" "Excellent, {HeroName}.  I hoped you would agree.  You are in for quite an adventure. You will have to travel back through the Midnight Squad Aspect of the Pillar to get to him. It is located inside the Midnighter Club."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


