// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Senator Decimus Aquila 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2511065280" "Senator Decimus Aquila"
// ProfessionString :
"P725892568" "Former Senator of Cimerora"
// DescriptionString :
"P2848220670" "Senator Aquila was once one of Cimerora's most respected elected officials and a key advisor to Imperious.  While he has been utterly stripped of his official title and its ranks and privileges, he is a kind-hearted man who now focuses his attentions to the needs and lives of the fort's citizens."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
// HelloString :
"P1097992599" "Hello."
// HelloString :
"P3455721567" "Lovely day, is it not?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P270602085" "I am a man of many talents, including the ability to place a face and a name, however I do not recognize you, stranger.  Perhaps if someone were to introduce you, then we could become acquainted."
// FirstVisitString :
"P910358359" "By the look of you, I would say that you have traveled a great distance.  Allow me to introduce myself: I am Senator Decimus Aquila.<br><br>Ah...forgive a foolish man.  I am the <i>former</i> senator of this beautiful peninsula.  My days as an elected official came to an end when Romulus and his men traitorously dethroned Imperious and took the title for himself.  These days, my aims are small.  I have to aid those who have chosen to remain true to Imperious and ensure their continued safety."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1986249737" "Our time together has been brief, it is true, but I am certain that there are others who could use someone as powerful as you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1140086539" "Ah, life is so very busy is it not?  It creeps up on you, little niggling errands that seem to pile on top of each other until one day it is hard to discern which way is up!  I must wait for now, but once you are free of obligations, I would enjoy a moment of your time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P347206865" "Begone, foul demigod!  You are truly the work of Hades!"
// IntroString :
"P85332422" "If you want to know a little about our town, you should speak to Senator Aquila.  He knows all the people here and can introduce you to some of the townsfolk, if you are interested."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P240981455" "Agree to be introduced to Senator Aquila"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2912612161" "Senator Aquila is a kind and gentle man.  He was one of our most respected senators before the insurrection.  I am sure he will be very helpful to you if you seek to gain some knowledge of Cimerora."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


